# This file documents the variables. Do NOT put real values here.
#
# Only TWO variables are required to run the end-to-end demo. Everything else
# below has a working default that points at public infrastructure, which is
# what lets a judge clone this repo and run it without credentials of ours.

# --- Required (both) ---------------------------------------------------

# The Hedera testnet account the buying agent pays from, and that owns the
# HCS topic it anchors to. Get one free at https://portal.hedera.com.
# Use a throwaway testnet account. This repo refuses to run against mainnet.
HEDERA_OPERATOR_ID=0.0.12345
HEDERA_OPERATOR_KEY=302e0201...

# --- Optional: all default to public infrastructure --------------------

# Hedera network. Defaults to "testnet". Anything else is refused at startup.
# HEDERA_NETWORK=testnet

# The x402-gated store the agent buys from. Defaults to the hosted deployment,
# so the demo works without running the store yourself. Live and public — no
# credentials needed to read /menu or to receive a 402 challenge.
# STORE_URL=https://hedera-proof-of-spend-store.vercel.app

# The receipt ledger. Defaults to the hosted askReceipts MCP endpoint.
# ASKRECEIPTS_URL=https://www.askreceipts.com/api/mcp

# Ledger auth. Defaults to a well-known PUBLIC demo token, on purpose: the
# verification walkthrough must not require a credential from us.
# ASKRECEIPTS_AGENT_KEY=ar_agent_demo_...

# The HCS topic receipts are anchored to. No default -- leave unset and the
# anchor package creates a fresh topic (with its submit key set to this
# operator's own key, so only this agent can write to it), then reuses it
# for the rest of that run. Capture the topic id it prints and set it here
# to reuse the SAME topic across runs. If set, it must be a topic this
# operator's key actually owns (verified live against the mirror node on
# every anchor) -- a topic with no submit key, or one owned by a different
# key, is refused rather than silently anchored to.
# HCS_TOPIC_ID=0.0.67890

# --- Store-side only (not needed to run the demo as a buyer) -----------

# The Hedera account the store is paid into.
# STORE_PAYEE_ID=0.0.54321
#
# The hosted x402 facilitator that verifies and settles payments. Blocky402's
# testnet facilitator is open access and needs no API key. Verified 2026-09-06:
# GET /supported lists exact/hedera:testnet at x402Version 2.
# The store refuses to start if this is unreachable or does not settle that.
# FACILITATOR_URL=https://api.testnet.blocky402.com
